---
import WebflowLayout from '../layouts/WebflowLayout.astro';
import WebflowContactForm from '../components/WebflowContactForm.astro';
---

<WebflowLayout
  title="About Us | Expert UX/UI Design Services | Koryun"
  description="We solve the most complex user experience challenges. Meet our team."
  bodyClass="body-5 body-3"
  wfPageId="63da515bccec2d011d89c485"
>
  <div class="about-us-hero-section">
    <div class="pictures w-container">
      <div class="w-layout-grid grid-14">
        <div class="div-block-53">
          <div class="text-block-about">We solve the most complex user experience challenges.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="div-block-67">
          <div class="text-block-37">Our experienced team of creative, strategic, technological, and problem-solving professionals is prepared to assist you in tackling your most challenging design issues.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img class="main-page-about-us" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621b68aa86678f4b4952a8d6/63e0c27cf46ebf2c8dae8512_about-us-3.jpg" alt="koryun experts" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="team-section-about">
    <div class="container-6 w-container">
      <div class="w-layout-grid grid-8">
        <div class="div-block-38">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621b68aa86678f4b4952a8d6/6433d8ece9cbf0c5bb4b38a4_vh-profile-pic.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Vazgen Harutyunyan" />
          <h3 class="text-block-38">Vazgen Harutyunyan</h3>
          <p class="text-block-39">UX designer | Co-Founder</p>
        </div>
        <div class="div-block-38-copy">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/621b68aa86678f4b4952a8d6/6433d9b16792dfd11ac11ae1_aram-final.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Aram Harutyunyan" />
          <h3 class="text-block-38">Aram Harutyunyan</h3>
          <p class="text-block-39">UX designer | Co-Founder</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="approach-section">
    <div class="container-6 w-container">
      <div class="approach-heading-about">Our approach to work</div>
      <div class="approach-paragraph-about">We collaborate with our clients as partners, our success is to take your business to the next level.</div>
      <div class="w-layout-grid grid-8-copy">
        <div>
          <div class="working-as-one-header">Working as one team</div>
          <div class="working-as-one-paragraph">We believe working closely with our clients is important. We communicate regularly and work towards a shared goal.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="technology-focused-header">Technology focused</div>
          <div class="technology-focused-paragraph">We hold that in order to design an exceptional product, it is necessary to have a thorough understanding of its technical workings.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="feedback-oriented-header">Feedback oriented</div>
          <div class="feedback-oriented-paragraph">We make sure that we move in the right direction through fast iterations, constant testing, and regular feedback sessions.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="why-choose-section">
    <div class="container-6 w-container">
      <div class="why-choose-heading">Why choose koryun?</div>
      <div class="why-choose-paragraph">Plenty of reasons, mentioning a few.</div>
      <div class="w-layout-grid grid-8-copy">
        <div>
          <div class="product-specialists">Product specialists</div>
          <div class="product-specialists-paragraph">We are 100% product focused. Our process marries business strategy with user feedback for the best possible outcome. You'll always know how delivering on KPI's as we measure the impact of our design as we go.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="extension-header">An extension to your team</div>
          <div class="extension-paragraph">We thrive on collaboration and work best when we're integrated with ambitious product teams. Our team are at home communicating with everyone across your organization, from engineers to senior management.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="partner-header">A proactive partner</div>
          <div class="partner-paragraph">We create productive, long-lasting client relationships that work towards a common goal. Our fine-tuned communication processes mean we're on the ball with reports and updates. You'll always know what's just happened and what's up next.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="strategic-value-header">Strategic value</div>
          <div class="strategic-value-paragraph">With years of industry experience there aren't many problems we haven't seen and solved before. We help organizations grow, improve processes and empower internal teams to be their best. You'll gain much more than just great design from our partnership.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <WebflowContactForm />
</WebflowLayout>
